# ─── Check-in API proxy ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The opus_pass deployment that serves /api/checkin/* and /api/checkin-report/*.
# This app keeps no check-in secrets of its own: every scan is verified by
# opus_pass server-side, exactly like the mobile app does it.
# Dev default: http://localhost:3008 (opus_pass's `npm run dev` port).
OPUS_PASS_URL="http://localhost:3008"
